   1               / Disassembly of the DMS RF08 driver.
   2               / This version is at offset 2400 in the BUILDER, dec-d8-sbaf-pb.
   3               / Nov 20 2023: VRS
   4               /       Downloaded the excellent start made by Dave R. from
   5               /       https://forum.vcfed.org/index.php?attachments/dms-stuff-zip.1268325/
   6               / Nov 21 2023: VRS
   7               /       Created this document, which hopes to still document things while
   8               /       actually assembling to re-create the original driver.
